{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37383","headline":"和陶渊明贫士诗七首 六 · 唐彦谦","name":"和陶渊明贫士诗七首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"村郊多父老，面垢头如蓬。\n我尝使之年，言语不待工。\n古来名节士，敢望彭城龚。\n有叟诮其後，更恨道不通。\n鄙哉譊譊者，爲隘不爲通。\n低头拜野老，负米吾愿从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}